   "like_count": 3,
   "cooked": "<h2>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#dyk-the-tec-is-on-gitcoin-grants-1\" name=\"dyk-the-tec-is-on-gitcoin-grants-1\"></a>DYK The TEC is on Gitcoin Grants?</h2>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://gitcoin.co/grants/1155/token-engineering-commons\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<img class=\"site-icon\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/31a031bb73e19e5212e343fa643c2caac8a0e334.png\" width=\"32\"/>\n<a href=\"https://gitcoin.co/grants/1155/token-engineering-commons\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Token Engineering Commons | Grants</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/189;\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/7152ace18b408d4326c2102a4143aef14c7df258_2_10x10.png\" height=\"189\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/7152ace18b408d4326c2102a4143aef14c7df258_2_690x189.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/7152ace18b408d4326c2102a4143aef14c7df258_2_690x189.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/7152ace18b408d4326c2102a4143aef14c7df258_2_1035x283.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/7152ace18b408d4326c2102a4143aef14c7df258_2_1380x378.jpeg 2x\" width=\"690\"/></div>\n<h3><a href=\"https://gitcoin.co/grants/1155/token-engineering-commons\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Token Engineering Commons | Grants</a></h3>\n<p>GR12\n2021.12.01 UPDATE\n\nTEC’s mission is to become the focal point for token engineering by funding the development of proposals that seek to create open source tools &amp; research, educational material, and token engineering narratives that advance...</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<h2>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#dyk-the-tec-has-over-13khttpsetherscanioaddress0x6868738d8e1e38e4bd2eb601262453d626d9648c-sitting-in-a-key-griff-controls-2\" name=\"dyk-the-tec-has-over-13khttpsetherscanioaddress0x6868738d8e1e38e4bd2eb601262453d626d9648c-sitting-in-a-key-griff-controls-2\"></a>DYK The TEC has over <a href=\"https://etherscan.io/address/0x6868738d8e1e38e4bd2eb601262453d626d9648c\">$13k</a> sitting in a key Griff controls!?</h2>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/f004d0164a86ef2032bffba9b2e41f1e0e846f7f\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/f004d0164a86ef2032bffba9b2e41f1e0e846f7f.png\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"yfiU4oK2Zu8XiNKXW20URwrcMxN\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f004d0164a86ef2032bffba9b2e41f1e0e846f7f_2_10x10.png\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f004d0164a86ef2032bffba9b2e41f1e0e846f7f_2_488x500.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f004d0164a86ef2032bffba9b2e41f1e0e846f7f_2_488x500.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/f004d0164a86ef2032bffba9b2e41f1e0e846f7f.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/f004d0164a86ef2032bffba9b2e41f1e0e846f7f.png 2x\" width=\"488\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">627×642 135 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-should-we-do-with-it-3\" name=\"what-should-we-do-with-it-3\"></a>What should we do with it?</h1>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#here-are-the-options-i-see-4\" name=\"here-are-the-options-i-see-4\"></a>Here are the options I see:</h3>\n<p><strong>Option 1:</strong> Convert it all to WXDAI and  it to Lasertag to use it to LP later.</p>\n<p><strong>Option 2:</strong> Convert the DAI and small amounts to WXDAI and leave the PAN and ETH as is and send it to Lasertag to use it to LP later.</p>\n<p><strong>Option 3:</strong> Convert it to WXDAI and send it to a Common Pool.</p>\n<p><strong>Option 4:</strong> Convert it to WXDAI then to TEC and send it to the Reward Board.</p>\n<p><strong>Option 5:</strong> Let it rot.</p>\n<p><strong>Option 6:</strong> Griff sells it and runs to Mexico and throws an EPIC party with Chuy during the TheDAOists conference in early March (my top pick)</p>\n<p>Any other ideas?</p>\n<p>I would love to do ranked choice voting via snapshot to decide this, that way I can legitimately vote for Option 6… and Tweet it!</p>",
